<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 21.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 21.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Friday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   RIC	 Yield     Close</p>
<p> 1 Prime Credit Tr	 10.32   0.95</p>
<p> 2 Prop Income Inv	  9.86   1.03</p>
<p> 3 Indu Property	    9.78   0.93</p>
<p> 4 BT Prop Trust	    9.71   1.68</p>
<p> 5 Villa World		9.65   1.14</p>
<p> 6 McIntosh Sec	     9.47   0.95</p>
<p> 7 Colonial Mutual	  9.20   1.15</p>
